------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCIENTIFIC MODELS & LIVE TELEMETRY DISCLAIMERS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Embedded 1D Crustal & Lithospheric Grid (CRUST1.0 / LITHO1.0):
  Derived from open academic models by Laske et al. (2013) and Pasyanos et al.
  (2014), paired with published rock conductivity priors by Alekseev et al.
  (2015) and Reynolds (1984).

- U.S. Federal Space Weather Telemetry (NASA DONKI / CDAWeb & NOAA SWPC):
  Public domain products under 17 U.S.C. § 105. AlertaSolar is an independent
  open-source engineering project and is not endorsed or certified by NASA or NOAA.

- Ground Magnetometer Networks (INTERMAGNET GIN & NRCan / FDSN):
  Real-time magnetometer series fetched directly by the end-user's browser
  remain the intellectual property of INTERMAGNET and participating national
  geomagnetic institutes, subject to their respective non-commercial usage terms.

- Operational Hazard Disclaimer:
  AlertaSolar provides dimensionless heuristic susceptibility indices and 1D
  Wait (1954) surface impedance estimates for situational awareness. It does not
  output physical induced voltages (V/km) or Geomagnetically Induced Currents
  in Amperes (A) on power grids or pipelines, and does not replace certified
  in-situ plant instrumentation.